indications_limitations:
&lt;p&gt; The Following Breath Test is Covered:&lt;&sol;p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt; 
&lt;li&gt; Lactose breath hydrogen to detect lactose malabsorption.&lt;&sol;li&gt;
&lt;&sol;ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt; The Following Breath Tests are Excluded from Coverage:&lt;&sol;p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt; 
&lt;li&gt; Lactulose breath hydrogen for diagnosing small bowel bacterial overgrowth and measuring small bowel transit time.&lt;&sol;li&gt;

&lt;li&gt; CO2 for diagnosing bile acid malabsorption.&lt;&sol;li&gt;

&lt;li&gt; CO2 for diagnosing fat malabsorption.&lt;&sol;li&gt;
&lt;&sol;ul&gt;
